# GRUB SHIFT: the autoplay bot (two moves ahead, eggs first) can win
# contract 1 on a fixed seed, which proves a full contract is playable end
# to end, and it wins a fair share of 20 seeded contracts (balance smoke
# test). Under Bug Hunter's growth rule, grubs left overnight can come back
# as queens; the bot wins roughly two in five.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 1001
cheat autoplay
expect status == 1
expect kills >= 30
expect botwins20 >= 6
